{"detail":{"message":"success","code":"SUCCESS","ok":true},"total_items":72,"total_pages":72,"page":1,"page_size":1,"data":[{"id":"1646151054582223040","sections":["economy"],"title":"증시 급등락에 선물·옵션 거래 급증 '사상최고'","publisher":"머니투데이","author":"","summary":"올 들어 국내 증시가 가파르게 상승하고 변동성이 커지면서 장내 선물, 옵션 거래 등 파생상품 거래가 급증했다.\n\n올 들어 장내 선물, 옵션 거래대금은 1경7000억원을 넘어섰다.\n\n만기인 12월 거래가 늘어날 것을 감안하면 올해 총 거래대금이 2경원을 넘을 가능성도 있다.","highlight":null,"score":null,"image_url":"https://ddi-cdn.deepsearch.com/news/economy/2025/11/29/1646151054582223040/000-d20132ded34c0ab5cf3b41acb62aba7c8db07d89.jpg","thumbnail_url":"https://ddi-cdn.deepsearch.com/news_thumbnail/economy/2025/11/29/1646151054582223040/000-d20132ded34c0ab5cf3b41acb62aba7c8db07d89.jpg","content_url":"https://www.mt.co.kr/stock/2025/11/29/2025112817491583621","esg":{"category":{"label":"U","name":"해당없음","score":1},"polarity":{"label":"0","name":"중립","score":1}},"companies":[{"name":"삼성증권","symbol":"016360","exchange":"KRX","sentiment":"neutral"}],"entities":[{"type":"company","name":"삼성증권"}],"published_at":"2025-11-29T07:00:00","body":null}]}